# pos_auto_takeoff.expect — POS_HOLD ARM-triggered auto-takeoff gates (redesign 2026-06-14)
# POS_HOLD の ARM トリガ自動離陸判定
#
# Same chain as alt_auto_takeoff plus the horizontal contract: ARM triggers the auto-
# takeoff (props stopped through the spool dwell), the climb captures the 0.5 m TARGET,
# and the craft stays over the launch point through the auto-climb and the hold.
# alt_auto_takeoff と同じ連鎖＋水平の契約: ARM が自動離陸をトリガ（スプールドウェル中
# プロペラ停止）、上昇は 0.5 m 目標を捕捉し、自動上昇とホールドの間、機体は発進点の真上に留まる。
exit 0
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → POS_HOLD"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
order "Mode change: STABILIZE → POS_HOLD" "ARM accepted"
order "ARM accepted" "Auto-takeoff engaged"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
metric duty_max < 0.05 in 7.55 7.78
metric alt_mean > 0.42 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_mean < 0.62 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_rmse < 0.08 in 12.0 16.0
# 2026-10-31 R_out plant: alt_band 0.20 -> 0.55 (basis (b): 14 real auto-takeoffs in ALT_HOLD/POS_HOLD, window
# takeoff+4.2..+8.2 s, ESKF altitude: alt_band p50 0.164, p90 0.443, max 0.521 -> real max rounded up; the old
# 0.20 was tuned to the old plant (value 0.008, below every real takeoff) / 実機14回の離陸（p50 0.164・p90 0.443・最大 0.521）の
# 最大を切り上げ。旧 0.20 は旧プラントの値 0.008（実機の全離陸より小さい）に合わせたもの
metric alt_band < 0.55 in 12.0 16.0
metric horizontal_drift_max < 0.5 in 9.0 16.0
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 12.0 16.0
metric tilt_max < 0.1745 in 9.0 16.0  # 10.0 deg
